                                "sense_id": "e1bf91af-bb68-3d5b-a032-397d732fc83f",
                                "text": "She at length consented to make us some oatmeal \"poddidge,\" and to let us sleep on a mattress in a corner of the kitchen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "65e7cde8-b132-49dd-a7db-89a9bb972a05",
                                "sense_id": "e1bf91af-bb68-3d5b-a032-397d732fc83f",
                                "text": "\"Nea,\" she thought, \"what wad she want supping my poddidge, when she wadn't have ony hersel? She'll get nea mair, howiver, an' it was her,\" she added, as she emptied the basin."
